  "id": "sustained-attention",
  "term": "sustained attention",
  "definition": "Sustained attention, also called vigilant attention, is the ability to keep attention focused and stay engaged with a task over time. It is an aspect of executive function that helps a person organize behavior to meet current demands and future goals.",
